      "source": "Good for Today, Great for Tomorrow\n\nThe PLAY PRO microSDXC™ Express Card is backwards-compatible with UHS-I and UHS-II host devices (at UHS-I speeds) so you can use it with your current handheld gaming consoles – and it's ideal for the microSD Express devices coming soon.",
